Time-Keeper

Dates and times with time zones, leap seconds, every locale and every calendar CLDR knows.

INSTALLATION

Time-Keeper-Zone must be installed first: Time::Keeper builds against it.

    perl Makefile.PL
    make
    make test
    make install

